\f0\b\fs48 \cf2 \expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Governed Multi-Agent Architecture (GMAA)\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 A reference architecture for running multiple AI agent seats and multiple human operators against a single codebase, such that no change lands without authorization at the correct unit, no claim closes without evidence, and no failure degrades silently.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 What you get\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0

\f2\b0\fs25\fsmilli12667 \cf2 ENGINE-MAP.md
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667 , at the root of the engine zip, lists every file in the engine and what it does, and marks the core files every seat reads end to end before its first act; if a file is not listed there, it is not part of the engine.\
A project where several agents (and the people directing them) write to one codebase and the trunk stays under control: one writer, every seat signing its own commits, a human ratifying each complete change-set, an auditor after every commit, agents that halt by name instead of improvising, and a record a new session boots from in minutes. After genesis the writer seat provisions every other seat on your roster, one set each that it lands on your go; genesis is complete when the roster exists and a fault you planted was caught. 
\f2\fs25\fsmilli12667 WHY-GMAA.md
\f1\fs29\fsmilli14667  says what it is, what it costs and when it fits.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

\f0\b\fs34\fsmilli17333 \cf2 The correction\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa186\partightenfactor0

\f1\b0\fs29\fsmilli14667 \cf2 Multi-agent systems fail by authorizing at the wrong unit: individual changes get approved while the coherence of the complete pending set goes unexamined. GMAA adds set-level authorization on top of per-change review, never instead of it. Both gates fire: each change is still reviewed on its own, an integrator agent assesses the complete pending set as a unit against the system's logic, evidence, live state, and invariants, and an independent human then ratifies that assessed set before any member commits.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sa160\partightenfactor0

